{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29079","headline":"朝台送客有怀 · 许浑","name":"朝台送客有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赵佗西拜已登坛，马援南征土宇宽。\n越国旧无唐印绶，蛮乡今有汉衣冠。\n江云带日秋偏热，海雨随风夏亦寒。\n岭北归人莫回首，蓼花枫叶万重滩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29079.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29079","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}